sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Merchant as MSME Merchant
    participant POS as Physical POS Counter
    participant Gateway as VyapaarSetu API Gateway
    participant Sync as Inventory Sync Engine (Redis/Go)
    participant Bus as Kafka Event Bus
    participant Storefront as Shopify / D2C Storefront
    participant DB as PostgreSQL OLTP DB
    participant Analytics as BigQuery OLAP Warehouse

    Merchant->>POS: Scan & Sell Item (SKU-JKT-0001)
    POS->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/inventory/deduct {qty: 1}
    Gateway->>Sync: Acquire Distributed Lock (Redlock)
    Sync->>DB: Deduct Offline Counter Stock (-1 Unit)
    Sync->>Bus: Publish Event: INVENTORY_DEDUCTED
    Bus-->>Storefront: Push Real-Time Stock Update (Shopify Webhook)
    Bus-->>Analytics: Debezium CDC Stream to BigQuery
    Sync-->>Gateway: 200 OK (Sync Time: 12ms)
    Gateway-->>POS: Print Receipt & Confirm Stock Synced
